  "notes": "Complete original medium-fi Chaillot Palace exterior:both exact-map curved wings,both central andterminal pavilions,mapped low service annex,four real open column colonnades with closed recessed glazing behind,stepped flat parapet roofs with picture-guided inset roof wells,andlower central theater/terrace with tall stone piers/closed glazing. Broad central view axis remains open above the terrace;fountains,gardens,statues,bas-reliefs,inscriptions,interiors andindependent city remain native or excluded. Two actually inspected ordinary pictures:one broad aerial andone central-pavilion end facade. Rear elevations,concealed roof/terrace interfaces,roof well depth,window/column inventory andhistoric levels are approximate. Sculpture,bas-reliefs andtext excluded. No private image textures. Physical-device timings andnumerical LOD errors remain unmeasured.",
